<title>JAPAN: Tokai Rika - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokai Rika - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 86.20		vs	   85.68</p>
<p> Operating	    1.29		vs	    1.55</p>
<p> Current		1.67		vs	    1.59</p>
<p> Net		  898    million    vs	  654    million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.30 yen	  vs	    8.96 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     73 million	  vs	  73 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.25 yen	  vs	    4.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokai Rika Co Ltd produces car parts and is affiliated with Tokyo Motor Corp.</p>
</text>
